<ProjectLayout slug="rainbow-rice-cake">
  <p>
    <em>rainbow rice cake</em> is a drawing-based project developed through
    a series of images, memories and fragments of personal history.
  </p>

  <p>
    The work reflects on military service, the relationship between mother
    and son, and the ways memory is reconstructed through drawing.
  </p>

